The Girl King is a drama, history, romance film directed by Mika Kaurismäki.

2
00:15:08,571 --> 00:15:14,571
A portrait of the brilliant, extravagant Kristina of Sweden, queen from age six, who fights the conservative forces
that are against her ideas to modernize Sweden and who have no tolerance for her awakening sexuality.

