01:08:08,571 --> 01:08:14,571
The Girl King is a 2015 biographical drama about Christina, Queen of Sweden.

10
01:15:42,857 --> 01:15:48,857
It was directed by Mika Kaurismäki and written by Michel Marc Bouchard who, after writing the screenplay for the film, wrote his stage play Christine, La
Reine-Garçon which enjoyed a successful run in 2012 at Montreal's Théâtre du Nouveau Monde and then in English at the Stratford Festival in 2014.

11
01:23:17,142 --> 01:23:23,142
The film premiered at the Montreal World Film Festival.

12
